      <p>OVS is a multi-layer virtual switch that enables large-scale, multi-server network virtualization.</p>
      <p><strong>Prerequisites</strong></p>
      <ul>
      <li>You installed a cluster on RHOSP that is configured for single-root input/output virtualization (SR-IOV).</li>
      <li>You installed the SR-IOV Network Operator on your cluster.</li>
