      </dl>
      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: sriovnetwork.openshift.io/v1\nkind: SriovNetworkNodePolicy\nmetadata:\n  name: \"hwoffload10\"\n  namespace: openshift-sriov-network-operator\nspec:\n  deviceType: netdevice\n  isRdma: true\n  nicSelector:\n    pfNames:\n    - ens5\n  nodeSelector:\n    feature.node.kubernetes.io/network-sriov.capable: 'true'\n  numVfs: 1\n  priority: 99\n  resourceName: \"hwoffload10\""} lang="yaml" title="The second virtual function interface" />
      <p>where:</p>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>kind</code></dt>
