      </dl>
      </li>
      <li>
      Create <code>NetworkAttachmentDefinition</code> resources for the two interfaces:
      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: k8s.cni.cncf.io/v1\nkind: NetworkAttachmentDefinition\nmetadata:\n  annotations:\n    k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/resourceName: openshift.io/hwoffload9\n  name: hwoffload9\n  namespace: default\nspec:\n    config: '{ \"cniVersion\":\"0.3.1\", \"name\":\"hwoffload9\",\"type\":\"host-device\",\"device\":\"ens6\"\n    }'"} lang="yaml" title="A NetworkAttachmentDefinition resource for the first interface" />
      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: k8s.cni.cncf.io/v1\nkind: NetworkAttachmentDefinition\nmetadata:\n  annotations:\n    k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/resourceName: openshift.io/hwoffload10\n  name: hwoffload10\n  namespace: default\nspec:\n    config: '{ \"cniVersion\":\"0.3.1\", \"name\":\"hwoffload10\",\"type\":\"host-device\",\"device\":\"ens5\"\n    }'"} lang="yaml" title="A NetworkAttachmentDefinition resource for the second interface" />
      </li>
